---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const bookUrl = 'https://calendar.notion.so/meet/cameronearloliver/qc3y04oud';

const scorecard = [
  { name: 'Revenue vs. plan', weeks: ['r','y','y','g','g','g'], now: '103%' },
  { name: 'Cash collected', weeks: ['y','y','g','g','y','y'], now: '88%' },
  { name: 'Gross margin', weeks: ['y','g','g','g','g','g'], now: '42%' },
  { name: 'Closed-won rate', weeks: ['r','r','y','y','g','g'], now: '31%' },
];
const cell = { g: '#5C7A3B', y: '#C08A2D', r: '#B0402F' };

const flywheel = ['Map it out', 'Fix the one that matters', 'Business jumps', 'Find the next'];
---

<Layout
  title="Growth Map | An operator who fixes what's holding your business back"
  description="You don't need more. You need to fix what you've got. I get into owner-led businesses ($1M–$20M), find the thing actually holding growth back, and fix it with you. Book a free call."
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <!-- 1 · HERO -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-36 -top-16 h-[620px] w-[620px] text-moss opacity-35" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true">
      <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.75">
        <path d="M300,80 C420,70 520,160 530,280 C540,400 460,520 330,530 C200,540 80,460 75,320 C70,180 180,90 300,80 Z" />
        <path d="M300,150 C388,142 462,196 470,286 C478,376 416,462 320,470 C224,478 140,420 136,312 C132,204 216,158 300,150 Z" />
        <path d="M300,215 C352,210 398,248 403,300 C408,352 372,404 316,409 C260,414 210,378 207,318 C204,258 248,220 300,215 Z" />
        <circle cx="300" cy="301" r="6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
      </g>
    </svg>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] md:gap-14">
      <div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-5xl leading-[1.04] text-ink sm:text-6xl md:text-[64px]">
          You're fixing the <em>wrong thing.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[48ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
          Let's find the one or two things actually holding your business back from growth.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href={bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block rounded-full border border-ink bg-ink px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-parchment transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
            Book a call
          </a>
          <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm text-fern">Free 30-minute call. No pitch.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
        <figure class="max-w-[340px]">
          <img src="/images/headshot.jpeg" alt="Cameron Oliver" class="w-full rounded-[16px] border border-hairline shadow-sm" loading="eager" />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · RESULTS BAND -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-hairline bg-ink px-6 py-9">
    <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 top-1/2 h-[360px] w-[360px] -translate-y-1/2 text-moss opacity-30" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true">
      <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.9">
        <path d="M300,80 C420,70 520,160 530,280 C540,400 460,520 330,530 C200,540 80,460 75,320 C70,180 180,90 300,80 Z" />
        <path d="M300,150 C388,142 462,196 470,286 C478,376 416,462 320,470 C224,478 140,420 136,312 C132,204 216,158 300,150 Z" />
        <circle cx="300" cy="301" r="6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
      </g>
    </svg>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-6 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg leading-tight text-cream md:text-[21px]">2&times; growth</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-moss">same headcount</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg leading-tight text-cream md:text-[21px]">Days &rarr; hours</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-moss">Telehealth</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg leading-tight text-cream md:text-[21px]">EBITDA up</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-moss">Private equity</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg leading-tight text-cream md:text-[21px]">Billable hours won back</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-moss">Law firm</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline bg-parchment-deep px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">How it works</p>
      <div class="mt-9 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] md:items-center md:gap-12">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-2xl font-medium text-moss">01</p>
            <h3 class="font-display mt-1 text-[22px] text-ink">I map it out</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">Everything going on in the business. What's working, what's wasting your time, what to stop.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-2xl font-medium text-moss">02</p>
            <h3 class="font-display mt-1 text-[22px] text-ink">I find the one that matters</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">The real thing holding you back. Usually not what you think. One guy didn't even know where his revenue was coming from.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-2xl font-medium text-moss">03</p>
            <h3 class="font-display mt-1 text-[22px] text-ink">I fix it, with you</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">Hands on the work, alongside your team. Whatever it actually is, we get it done, not just decided.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/70 p-6">
          <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-fern">I put it in plain numbers</p>
          {scorecard.map((m) => (
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-dashed border-hairline py-2.5 first:border-t-0">
              <span class="text-[13.5px] font-medium text-ink">{m.name}</span>
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                {m.weeks.map((w) => (<span class="h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded-[3px]" style={`background:${cell[w]}`}></span>))}
                <span class="ml-2 w-10 text-right font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">{m.now}</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          ))}
          <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-fern">Sample &middot; six weeks, your metrics</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 · FLYWHEEL -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px]">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
        This is how you actually scale.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[60ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
        Find the biggest thing, fix it, and the business jumps. Then we go again. One real win a quarter, and it stacks up.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">
        {flywheel.map((step, i) => (
          <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-5">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-moss">{`0${i + 1}`}</p>
            <p class="font-display mt-2 text-[19px] leading-snug text-ink">{step}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-fern">&hellip; and again &rarr;</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 · PROOF -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline bg-parchment-deep px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">What that looks like</p>
      <div class="mt-9 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-ink">
            He didn't know where his revenue was even coming from.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-fern">
            He was focused on all the wrong things. We changed the sales process and doubled his growth, same headcount.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-ink">
            He was sure he needed more sales.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-fern">
            It wasn't sales. It was conversion, and saying no to the wrong customers. Different problem, different fix.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/testimonials" class="mt-8 inline-block font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-moss transition-colors hover:text-ink">More results &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7 · HOW IT STARTS -->
  <section class="px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-[40px]">
        Let's talk.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 text-left sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div><p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-moss">01</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-fern">We talk. You tell me what's going on.</p></div>
        <div><p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-moss">02</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-fern">I tell you the first thing I'd fix.</p></div>
        <div><p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-moss">03</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-fern">You decide: with me, without me, or someone else.</p></div>
      </div>
      <a href={bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-9 inline-block rounded-full border border-ink bg-ink px-9 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-parchment transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
        Book a call
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm text-fern">No pitch. If I can't help, I'll tell you who can.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
